    "description": "Widgets Art - Wallpaper, Theme is a super practical and beautiful desktop widget personalized decoration mobile application. Widgets Art - Wallpaper, Theme which is used by tens of millions of people is waiting for you!\r\n\r\nWidgets, wallpapers, themes, app icons, and all phone decorations are here! Each widget has its unique functionality, such as a calendar, digital clock, equipment panel, weather, and more. Each set of exquisite themes has been carefully polished and designed.\r\n\r\n<b>\ufe0fMultifunctional and Well-designed Dynamic Island</b>\r\n\r\n1, Charging, intimate reminder.\r\n2, Here comes the message, open it quickly.\r\n3, Favorite music, one-click to play!\r\n4, Personalized decoration for home screen!\r\n\r\n<b>Vinyl Record, CD Player Widget</b>\r\n\r\n1, Put music on your desktop!\r\n2, Feel free to click to switch while listening to music!\r\n3, Music player, light up your phone, activate your personality!\r\n4, Try it out and enjoy now!\r\n\r\nIn addition to complete functions, the content styles of Widgets Art - Wallpaper, Theme are all-inclusive and colorful. Cute cartoon characters and mini hearts brighten your day. Glitter and gradient design wallpapers make your home screen full of vitality. Themify your desktop with Widgets Art - Wallpaper, Theme, there will be various surprises that you can meet. \r\n\r\n<b>Contact us</b>\r\n\r\nWidgets Art - Wallpaper, Theme can also answer your feedback. If you have any questions, you can contact our email at any time, and we will help you online as soon as possible.\r\nE-mail address: liruiqus@gmail.com\r\n\r\nDisclosure:\r\nYou can choose to enable the Accessibility permission so that the Dynamic Island will not be blocked by the status bar when it is displayed on the desktop. A better and more excellent user experience can be obtained in this way. Rest assured, we do not collect any information through this permission. Just use it with confidence.\r\n\r\nDon't wait any longer! Multiple trendy widgets, themes, wallpapers, and icons are all in Widgets Art - Wallpaper, Theme! Download and enjoy it now!",
